# Immutable upstream import, literal quilt patches and deterministic generated
# distributions. Retain their source bytes and whitespace exactly: the
# 20-patch builder plus package/CI parity gates validate these directories.
# All Hub-authored scripts, tests, adapters and other files retain Git's
# default whitespace checks (no repository-wide exemption).
pstack/** whitespace=-blank-at-eol,-blank-at-eof,-space-before-tab
patches/** whitespace=-blank-at-eol,-blank-at-eof,-space-before-tab
harness/** whitespace=-blank-at-eol,-blank-at-eof,-space-before-tab
